<glossentry id="glossentry-388" class="- topic/topic concept/concept glossentry/glossentry "><glossterm class="- topic/title concept/title glossentry/glossterm ">TAZ</glossterm><glossdef class="- topic/abstract concept/abstract glossentry/glossdef "><p class="- topic/p ">Transportation Analysis Zone are standard zones created by the US Census Bureau. They differ in geographical size, but they encompass a population of approximately 3000 people in their area.</p></glossdef><glossBody class="- topic/body concept/conbody glossentry/glossBody "/></glossentry>